#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:5 853c062732fe43a1b73278afa930b9b4
msgid "LOITER Mode"
msgstr "LOITER 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:7 cef0170c74ae4cc585fbcfd52d9b508c
msgid ""
"In LOITER mode the plane will circle around the point where you started the "
"loiter, holding altitude at the altitude that you entered loiter in. The "
"radius of the circle is controlled by the ``WP_LOITER_RAD`` parameter, but "
"is also limited by your ``NAV_ROLL_CD`` limit, and your ``NAVL1_PERIOD`` "
"navigation tuning. As with :ref:`Return To Launch (RTL) <rtl-mode>` and "
":ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` mode you can \"nudge\" the plane while in LOITER "
"using stick mixing, if enabled."
msgstr ""
"在 LOITER 模式下，飞机将围绕您开始盘旋的点盘旋，保持进入盘旋时的高度。圆圈半径由 ``WP_LOITER_RAD`` 参数控制，但也受 "
"``NAV_ROLL_CD`` 限制和 ``NAVL1_PERIOD`` 导航调参的限制。与 :ref:`Return To Launch (RTL) "
"<rtl-mode>` 和 :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` 模式一样，如果启用了摇杆混控，您可以在 LOITER 时「微调」飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:15 a869247e5c294ab99a8c1f3a3442a253
msgid ""
"If :ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bit 12 is set (+4096 to value) and "
":ref:`STICK_MIXING<STICK_MIXING>` is set to 1, then altitude of the loiter "
"can be changed using the pitch stick, as in FBWB mode."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 位 12 被设置（+4096 到值）且 "
":ref:`STICK_MIXING<STICK_MIXING>` 设为 1，则可以使用俯仰摇杆改变盘旋高度，就像在 FBWB 模式中一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:19 2a04ee191c4f49ea9ba815d9f398d7ec
msgid ""
"\"Home\" position is always supposed to be your Plane's actual GPS takeoff "
"location:"
msgstr "「Home」位置应始终是您的 Plane 实际 GPS 起飞位置："

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:22 b989f481ad95421185dcebfbaebde490
msgid ""
"It is very important to acquire GPS lock before arming in order for RTL, "
"Loiter, Auto or any GPS dependent mode to work properly."
msgstr "非常重要的是，在解锁前获得 GPS 定位，以确保 RTL、Loiter、Auto 或任何 GPS 依赖模式正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:24 4085c72c913d4e1691c13a778e23b206
msgid ""
"For Plane the home position is initially established at the time the plane "
"acquires its GPS lock. It is then continuously updated as long as the "
"autopilot is disarmed."
msgstr "对于 Plane，Home 位置最初在飞机获取 GPS 定位时建立。此后，只要飞控处于上锁状态，Home 位置将持续更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:28 af1cb0f35f1c41f2ab428d1ff5419804
msgid ""
"This means if you execute an RTL in Plane, it will return to the location "
"where it was when it was armed - assuming it had acquired GPS lock."
msgstr "这意味着如果您在 Plane 中执行 RTL，它将返回到解锁时所在的位置——前提是已获取 GPS 定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:29 aae3d963b6bb4f9581bfc5e75dfcedff
msgid ""
"Consider the use of :ref:`Rally Points <common-rally-points>` to avoid "
"returning directly to your arming point on RTL."
msgstr "考虑使用 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>` 以避免 RTL 时直接返回解锁点。"
